{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Adding-a-GeoJSON-file-to-the-map","level":2,"text":"Adding a GeoJSON file to the map"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"MapLibre iOS offers several ways to work with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"http:\/\/geojson.org\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" files.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GeoJSON is a standard file format for representing geographic data.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can host a GeoJSON file or bundle it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your application, you can use a GeoJSON file as the basis of an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object. Pass the file’s URL into the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" initializer and add the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shape source to the map using the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" method. The URL may","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be a local file URL, an HTTP URL, or an HTTPS URL.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you’ve added the GeoJSON file to the map via an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can configure the appearance of its data and control what data is visible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. You can also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"#Extracting-GeoJSON-data-from-the-map","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Converting-GeoJSON-data-into-shape-objects","level":2,"text":"Converting GeoJSON data into shape objects"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have GeoJSON data in the form of source code (also known as “GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text”), you can convert it into an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object that the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class understands"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively. First, create an "},{"code":"NSData","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object out of the source code string or file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contents, then pass that data object into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/shapeWithData:encoding:error:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method. Finally, you can pass the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resulting shape or feature object into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" initializer and add it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the map, or you can use the object and its properties to power non-map-related"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"functionality in your application."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To include multiple shapes in the source, create and pass an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shape:options:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Alternatively, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:shapes:options:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method to create a shape source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with an array. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:features:options:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances, such as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointFeature","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects, whose attributes you can use when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applying a predicate to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","type":"reference"},{"text":" or configuring a style layer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appearance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Extracting-GeoJSON-data-from-the-map","level":2,"text":"Extracting GeoJSON data from the map"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","type":"reference"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","type":"reference"},{"text":" object has an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape\/geoJSONDataUsingEncoding:","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" method that you can use to create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON source code representation of the object. You can extract a feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"object from the map using a method such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleFeaturesAtPoint:","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"About-GeoJSON-deserialization","level":2,"text":"About GeoJSON deserialization","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The process of converting GeoJSON text into "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" objects is known as “GeoJSON deserialization”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON geometries, features, and feature collections are known in this SDK as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shapes, features, and shape collection features, respectively."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each GeoJSON object type corresponds to a type provided by either this SDK or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Core Location framework:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON object type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SDK type"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" (longitude, latitude)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"type":"text","text":" (latitude, longitude)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Point"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiPoint"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointCollection","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LineString"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolyline","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiLineString"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolyline","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Polygon"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiPolygon"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GeometryCollection"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Feature"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FeatureCollection"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollectionFeature","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"Feature","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object in GeoJSON corresponds to an instance of an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subclass conforming to the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. There is a distinct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNFeature"},{"type":"text","text":"-conforming class for each type of geometry that a GeoJSON feature"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can contain. This allows features to be used as raw shapes where convenient. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, some features can be added to a map view as annotations. Note that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifiers and attributes will not be available for feature querying when a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature is used as an annotation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In contrast to the GeoJSON standard, it is possible for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" subclasses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other than "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to straddle the antimeridian."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following GeoJSON data types correspond straightforwardly to Foundation data"},{"type":"t